Z||000038||watts||12-15-2001||03:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BtotheB:<BR><B>$1.58 US = $1 CDN? Hehe, think you should've divided there   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My slight error...<BR>I was saying it's $2.27cdn per US gallon.  It's $2.27 canadian times the exchange rate, which give you roughly $3.59 CANADIAN per US gallon. (not US per US gallon)<P>||||reg||1
